stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Under review" as UnderReview
  state "In progress" as InProgress
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Submitted: school submits
  Submitted --> UnderReview: directorate starts review
  Submitted --> Returned: directorate asks for clarification
  UnderReview --> Returned: directorate asks for clarification
  Returned --> UnderReview: school replies
  Submitted --> Approved: directorate approves
  UnderReview --> Approved: directorate approves
  Submitted --> Rejected: rejects (reason required)
  UnderReview --> Rejected: rejects (reason required)
  Approved --> InProgress: directorate starts work
  Approved --> Completed: directorate completes
  InProgress --> Completed: directorate completes
  Completed --> Closed: school confirms
  Rejected --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
